.TH sam-jail-scan 1 2026-11-16 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-scan \- Find AppImages in the scan directories
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail scan\fR [\fB\-\-add\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIDIRS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find AppImages in the scan directories
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-add\fR
Register every new AppImage found
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIDIRS\fR]
Directories to scan (default: configured scan directories)
